{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbs","name":"Biblica® 圣经当代译本开放资源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBS","englishName":"Mandarin Chinese Open Contemporary Bible (Simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"74bf453a33641322ae4ddd23e051ee64d1412722972e541371ef97308285fe7d","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ROM","translationId":"cmn_cbs","name":"罗马书","commonName":"罗马书","title":"罗马书","order":45,"numberOfChapters":16,"sha256":"f17302e149fed1e38f90b58a032375190a256d10c3b29f06d530401a01210ee2","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ROM/1.json","lastChapterNumber":16,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ROM/16.json","totalNumberOfVerses":431},"chapter":{"number":3,"content":[{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["那么，犹太人有什么长处呢？割礼有什么价值呢？"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["其实在各方面有很多好处！首先，上帝的圣言托付给了犹太人。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["虽然有些人不信，但那有什么关系呢？难道上帝的信实可靠会因他们的不信而化为无有吗？"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["当然不会！纵然人人都撒谎，上帝仍然真实可靠。正如圣经上说：",{"text":"“你的判语证明你是公义的；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你虽被人控告，却终必得胜。”","poem":1},{"noteId":4}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["我姑且用人的观点说：“如果我们的不义反衬出上帝的公义，我们该怎么说呢？上帝向我们发怒是祂不公正吗？”"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["当然不是！若是这样，上帝怎么能审判这世界呢？"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["也许有人说：“如果我们的虚谎凸显出上帝的真实，增加祂的荣耀，为什么祂还要把我们当作罪人审判呢？”"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["为什么不干脆说“我们作恶吧，好成就善事”？有人毁谤我们，说我们传这种道理。这些人受审判是罪有应得！"]},{"type":"heading","content":["没有义人"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["那么，我们犹太人比别人优越吗？绝对不是！我们已经说过，无论是犹太人还是希腊人，所有的人都在罪的权势之下。"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["正如圣经上说：",{"text":"“没有义人，连一个也没有，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"没有人明白，没有人寻求上帝。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"人人偏离正道，变得毫无价值。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"无人行善，连一个也没有。","poem":1},{"noteId":5}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们的喉咙是敞开的坟墓，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"舌头上尽是诡诈，","poem":1},{"noteId":6},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"嘴唇有蛇的毒液，","poem":1},{"noteId":7}]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"满口咒诅，言语恶毒；","poem":1},{"noteId":8}]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"杀人流血，脚步飞快；","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"所到之处，大肆毁灭；","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们不知道平安之路；","poem":1},{"noteId":9}]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们眼中对上帝毫无畏惧。”","poem":1},{"noteId":10}]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":["我们知道律法所讲的都是针对律法之下的人，好叫所有的人都无话可说，使全世界都伏在上帝的审判之下。"]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":["因为无人能够靠遵行律法被上帝称为义人，律法的本意是要使人知罪。"]},{"type":"heading","content":["因信称义"]},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":["但如今，上帝的义在律法以外显明出来，有律法和众先知做见证。"]},{"type":"verse","number":22,"content":["人只要信耶稣基督，就可以被上帝称为义人，没有一个人例外。"]},{"type":"verse","number":23,"content":["因为世人都犯了罪，亏缺上帝的荣耀，"]},{"type":"verse","number":24,"content":["但蒙上帝的恩典，靠着基督耶稣的救赎，就被无条件地称为义人。"]},{"type":"verse","number":25,"content":["上帝借基督耶稣所流的血使祂成为赎罪祭，让人凭信心领受。这是为了显明上帝的义，因为祂用忍耐的心宽容人过去的罪，"]},{"type":"verse","number":26,"content":["好在现今显明祂的义，使人知道祂是公义的，祂也称信耶稣的为义人。"]},{"type":"verse","number":27,"content":["既然如此，我们哪里能夸口呢？当然没有可夸的。靠什么方法让人不能夸口呢？靠遵行律法吗？不是！是靠信主的方法。"]},{"type":"verse","number":28,"content":["因为我们坚信人被称为义人是借着信，不是靠遵行律法。"]},{"type":"verse","number":29,"content":["难道上帝只是犹太人的上帝吗？祂不也是外族人的上帝吗？祂当然也是外族人的上帝。"]},{"type":"verse","number":30,"content":["因为上帝只有一位，祂本着信称受割礼的人为义人，也本着信称未受割礼的人为义人。"]},{"type":"verse","number":31,"content":["这么说来，我们是借着信废掉上帝的律法吗？当然不是！我们反倒是巩固律法。"]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":4,"caller":"+","text":"诗篇51:4。","reference":{"chapter":3,"verse":4}},{"noteId":5,"caller":"+","text":"诗篇14:1‑3；53:1‑3；传道书7:20。","reference":{"chapter":3,"verse":12}},{"noteId":6,"caller":"+","text":"诗篇5:9。","reference":{"chapter":3,"verse":13}},{"noteId":7,"caller":"+","text":"诗篇140:3。","reference":{"chapter":3,"verse":13}},{"noteId":8,"caller":"+","text":"诗篇10:7。","reference":{"chapter":3,"verse":14}},{"noteId":9,"caller":"+","text":"以赛亚书59:7、8。","reference":{"chapter":3,"verse":17}},{"noteId":10,"caller":"+","text":"诗篇36:1。","reference":{"chapter":3,"verse":18}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ROM/3.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ROM/4.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ROM/2.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":31}